Simple Icons
------------
The console embeds a subset of brand icons from Simple Icons
(https://simpleicons.org, https://github.com/simple-icons/simple-icons),
version 16.35.0, pinned as the devDependency "simple-icons" in web/package.json.
web/scripts/gen-brand-icons.mjs copies only the icons the upstream catalog
uses into web/src/brandIcons.ts, so the console works offline and loads
nothing from a CDN.

Simple Icons is dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal
(https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/). The CC0 dedication
covers the icon artwork as distributed by that project; it does not grant any
rights in the trademarks themselves.

Trademarks: all logos are trademarks or registered trademarks of their
respective owners. Kuvryn Ant uses them only to identify the upstream
registry or repository a source points at. Their use does not imply
affiliation with, or endorsement by, those owners.

